# NEVER-PUBLISH. Private correspondence with the first author; consent to quote
# it on the record has not been given. It is generated OUTSIDE this tree by
# scripts/t5_anon_transcript.py and reaches reviewers only through the
# anonymised bundle. It was committed and briefly public on 2026-08-28 (M-48);
# this pattern, and submission_check.py's public-tree gate, are what stop it
# coming back.
docs/SUPPLEMENTARY_CORRESPONDENCE.md
SUPPLEMENTARY_CORRESPONDENCE.md

# per-triple (trajectory, step, dimension) arrays, Session 2 addendum B.
# Tens of megabytes of intermediates. Deliberately NOT under results/: the paper
# cites "0.90% of the 905,391 numeric values under results/" in §8 and Appendix D,
# and writing intermediates there would move a denominator the paper commits to.
cache/

# pre-submission programme: local copies of the original papers (plan S1). Not ours to
# redistribute, so never committed.
docs/presubmission/sources/

# Round 3, R5 (H6): the reports reproduce.sh stages write that nothing reads -- no script, no
